<title>USA: Central U.S. carlot pork at 1500 CDT - USDA.</title>
<headline>Central U.S. carlot pork at 1500 CDT - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fresh loins $1.00-4.00 higher; butts 3.00-4.00 higher; skinned hams 17-20#'s 1.50 lower, 20-26#'s generally steady; bellies 14-16#'s 1.00 lower; lean trimmings weak.</p>
<p>Trading slow to moderate, with light to moderate demand and offerings. -USDA</p>
